# Wave W17-K (Gloom Cave): gloom floor — near-black warm earth flags of the mountain gut, the flag joints sunk darker, a sparse amber fleck where the torches catch the stone and the odd dark burrow pit pocking the earth (design: a black torch-lit cave, warm dark pools, DRILLET burrows in the soft earth). The Gloom’s own floor — near-black WARM earth, split from Junction Deep’s lit warm-grey road flags by value and hue, and from the Crown Road’s violet-charcoal ceremonial flags by hue.
